<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 15/16.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 15/16.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, April 16 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   16.04.97	  15.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.000	     4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4924	    6.4990</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3117	    2.3242</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5206	    4.5378</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1712	    3.1626</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5211	    0.5243</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7736	    0.7782</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2890	    0.2905</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8394	    6.8476</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6969	    0.6958</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2785	    1.2821</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
